  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agri-NBSAPs Support Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under the scope of the Agri-NBSAPs Support Initiative, this project will contribute to strategic outcome two ?evidence-based implementation? and four ?building knowledge?, through providing data to fill knowledge and capacity gaps, and practical tools to accelerate implementation of the KMGBF, with a particular focus on Target 10 (Enhance Biodiversity and Sustainability in Agriculture, Aquaculture, Fisheries, and Forestry).Through the delivery of this support, this project contributes to achieving Target 19 (Mobilize Finance for Biodiversity) through increasing the level of financial resources to implement NBSAPs.</narrative>
  </description>
